# Public update repository: only the downloadable release files are tracked.
# Everything else - in particular any source or build directory that ends up
# in a checkout shared with the private repository - is ignored, so an
# accidental `git add -A` cannot publish code.
*
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!RELEASE_NOTES.md
!manifest.json
!firmware.bin
!littlefs.bin
!bootloader.bin
!partitions.bin
